# 👋 Hi, I'm Sahil (CodeBeeny)!
### Full-Stack Developer | Java Specialist | AI Enthusiast

I’m a software engineer passionate about building high-impact, real-time applications that solve complex problems. Currently, I'm focusing on creating "premium" user experiences and scalable backend architectures.

---

### 🚀 Featured Projects

#### 🌩️ [Crisis-Sync](https://github.com/CodeBeeny/crisis-sync)
*Real-Time Disaster Relief & Coordination Platform*
- **The Problem**: Lack of real-time communication during natural disasters.
- **The Solution**: A multi-user platform for emergency requests, volunteer tracking, and resource allocation.
- **Stack**: React, Node.js, Socket.io, Leaflet.js
- **Key Features**: Live request localization, glassmorphism UI, interactive safety checklists.

#### 🎓 [Student Data Manager](https://github.com/CodeBeeny/student-management)
*Full-Stack Enterprise Management System*
- **The Problem**: Inefficient student-teacher data tracking in large institutions.
- **The Solution**: A robust system for managing grades, attendance, and schedules with secure access.
- **Stack**: Java (Spring Boot), PostgreSQL, React, JWT
- **Key Features**: Role-based access control (RBAC), automated report generation, RESTful API.

#### 🧠 [Emotion Analyzer](https://github.com/CodeBeeny/emotion-analyzer)
*Machine Learning Content Analysis*
- **The Problem**: Identifying sentiment and emotional tone in unstructured text.
- **The Solution**: An NLP-based model that classifies emotions with 90%+ accuracy.
- **Stack**: Python, TensorFlow/Keras, NLTK
- **Key Features**: Real-time text processing, visual data insights, multi-label classification.

